From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 05:17:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] thunderbolt: bring to #1314's final revision

Bring to its revision in aurora-silicon/linux#1314:
commit 4a2f182576da ("thunderbolt: keep PCIe and USB tunnels across a
host router power cycle").
This tree carried an earlier revision:
commit 893c32434917 ("thunderbolt: keep PCIe and USB tunnels across a
host router power cycle").
Only the difference between the two.

Based on 4a2f182576da from aurora-silicon/linux#1314
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 drivers/thunderbolt/switch.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/thunderbolt/switch.c b/drivers/thunderbolt/switch.c
index 29a6a6a5a4..29855eed7a 100644
--- a/drivers/thunderbolt/switch.c
+++ b/drivers/thunderbolt/switch.c
@@ -3758,8 +3758,9 @@ int tb_switch_suspend_cio(struct tb_switch *sw)
 	unsigned int wake = 0;
 	int ret;
 
+	/* It returns the CL states it disabled. */
 	ret = tb_switch_clx_disable(sw);
-	if (ret)
+	if (ret < 0)
 		return ret;
 	ret = tb_plug_events_active(sw, false);
 	if (ret)
-- 
